          'Furthermore, premier restaurants participate in the FSSAI Food Hygiene Rating scheme, where accredited third-party auditing agencies evaluate operational practices across three core pillars: food handling hygiene, structural conditions and physical cleanliness, and food safety management systems. Establishments scoring top ratings (represented by 4 or 5 smiles) adhere to rigorous standards regarding employee hand hygiene, stainless-steel food contact surfaces, and pest control programs.',
